    "description": "《玉盘》\n今人不见古时月\n今月曾经照古人\n\n注意！以下为互动说明：\n1.点击右侧按键（屏幕右侧旋转的白色三角标识）可以展开菜单，并进行各种设置和互动，包括：\n       a) 播放和暂停按钮可以实现背景音乐的播放和暂停；\n       b) 下方的两个圆形按钮可以控制两个天体运行轨道的显示和隐藏；\n2.单击时钟可以隐藏背景文字和按钮（白色三角标识）；\n3.初次尝试3d壁纸，可能对电脑性能有一定需求，如果性能不佳或许可以尝试关掉粒子效果；\n\n感谢订阅和点赞~\n有问题可以在此反馈，尽力修复。\n\nTranslation:\n《Jade Plate》 by Li Bai\n(A Chinese philosophical poem about the moon)\n\"Those today see not the moon of ancient times,\nYet this moon once shone upon those of antiquity.\"\n\nInteractive Guide:\n\n1.Tap the rotating white triangle icon (right edge) to open the menu:\n\n     a) Play/Pause: Toggle background music.\n     b) Two circular buttons (bottom): Show/hide celestial orbits.\n\n2.Click the clock to hide all UI elements (including the triangle icon).\n\n3.Performance Note: This experimental 3D wallpaper may require moderate hardware. If lag occurs, disable particle effects.\n\nThank you for your support!\n\n If you encounter a bug during the customization process, please reset the wallpaper first and give me feedback;",
